                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A god awful game. I bought this in a bundle from fanatical, so i practically got it for free, however it is sooo bad.\nThe scaling is really off everywhere in the game, one moment youre as big as a fish, and another moment youe as big as a normal person. This game feels like a mobile VR port, due to it not using controllers. \n\nThe worst part was the entire game. Because its an underwater rollercoaster. It made me feel really dizzy, and while playing this i actually fell over and had to stay on the ground. It is also only 2 minutes. \n\nDO NOT BUY THIS.",
